---

## Risk vs Strategy

Strategy determines:

"Do I want to propose this trade?"

Risk determines:

"Are we allowed to take this exposure?"

These must remain separate.

---

## No Silent Overrides

Risk rules may only be overridden through explicitly designed mechanisms.

Never introduce:

if emergency:
    bypass_risk()

without explicit architecture and tests.
